OL,3,ACrimean Bridge attacked again, Russia
OL,4,Asays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Crimean Bridge has been attacked by
OL,7,FUkraine for the third time this week,
OL,8,FRussia has said.
OL,10,FThe Moscow-installed head of Crimea,
OL,11,FSergei Aksyonov, said that traffic was
OL,12,Ftemporarily suspended following another
OL,13,Fstrike on the bridge connecting Russia
OL,14,Fto occupied Crimea.
OL,16,FThe critical bridge had already been
OL,17,Fhit twice earlier in the week resulting
OL,18,Fin severe damage and part of the bridge
OL,19,Fcollapsing into the water.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
