OL,3,ACrimean Bridge attacked again, Russia
OL,4,Asays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe important infrastructure has long
OL,7,Fbeen targeted by Ukraine because of its
OL,8,Fsignificance as a logistical and
OL,9,Fsymbolic asset to Moscow's war effort.
